{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_373AD0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":8,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"Huey，你的ID卡用不了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"这张ID没法解除门锁！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":29,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不会吧……！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"怎么了！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"……她就这么讨厌我吗……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"Huey。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":7,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"……ID的授权是由Strangelove负责的。就算以前能用的ID卡，也可能会被取消权限。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"……比如，她开始讨厌某个人之后。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"……你心里有数？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"算是吧……。……我可不觉得她喜欢我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"这下麻烦了……。外面的士兵也没有进入<R=研究室,LAB>的权限，就算抢他们的卡也没用……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=研究室,LAB>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":122,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"知道了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":8,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"Kaz，Cécile呢？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":19,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"她刚到。等一下。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":8,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"Cécile，当了一回鸟是什么感觉？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":43,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"太棒了。我多少有点明白鸟是什么感觉了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"我都在想，要不别研究鸟了，干脆自己去飞。对了，怎么了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"你说过自己拿到了一张ID卡，对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"嗯……。不过有一次被警卫抓住时，卡被没收了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"被拿走了！？是什么样的人？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"他穿着橙色夹克。脸我记不清了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"那些人长得都差不多。在哪里？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"让我想想……。啊，我记得那里有“quetzal”的叫声。没错。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"真不愧是<R=观鸟者,BIRDER>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=观鸟者,BIRDER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"想听听quetzal的叫声吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":31,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"咦？这个叫声是？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"是我的quetzal。我被回收的时候，把它也一起带来了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":70,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"我记得你说过，它属于《华盛顿公约》的保护对象……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"骗你的。刚才那是我模仿的。鸟类学家连这点本事都得会。很像吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"真是个了不起的女人……。","